DECISIONS 341, 343: an output under a consumer root, which canon build never writes, still counts: a load of it is E8026 under check.
-- project.canon --
project acme {
  canon: "0.1"
  roots {
    admin: "../admin"
  }
  consumer_roots: [admin]
}
-- a/a.canon --
/// A.
package a

/// V.
let v: Int = 1

/// Fed.
let fed: String = load.text("@admin/json/v.json")

emit json { out: "@admin/json/" }
-- ../admin/json/v.json --
{"v": 1}
-- check-only --
-- findings.txt --
error[E8026]  a/a.canon:8:19
  @admin/json/v.json is read by this load and written by emit json of a: an output is never an input of its own build

1 error, 0 warnings in 1 package (…)
